<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="WhisperLoud is a place for honest thoughts, bold conversations, and curious people.">
  <title>WhisperLoud | Say what matters</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Smooch+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/index.css">
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.7.1/gsap.min.js" defer></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.7.1/ScrollTrigger.min.js" defer></script>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="navbar">
    <a class="Brand" href="#HOME" aria-label="WhisperLoud home">WhisperLoud</a>
    <button class="menu-button" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-menu">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
    <nav class="site-menu" id="site-menu" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#HOME">Home</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#terms">Guidelines</a>
      <a href="#footer">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="HOME">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">A place for the unfiltered you</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Whisper<br><em>Loud.</em></h1>
      <div class="hero-bottom">
        <p>Share the thought that keeps circling back. Find people who understand it, challenge it, or simply listen.</p>
        <a class="primary-link" href="/login">Enter the conversation <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">WL / 01</div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro-band" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <p class="section-number">01 / WHY WHISPERLOUD</p>
      <div class="intro-grid">
        <h2 id="about-title">Room for<br><span>real thoughts.</span></h2>
        <div class="intro-copy">
          <p>Some conversations need more than a like. WhisperLoud gives your ideas room to breathe, whether they arrive as a considered argument, a late-night question, or a joke that is too good to keep private.</p>
          <p class="copy-note">No performance. No perfect feed. Just people making space for a point of view.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-grid" aria-label="WhisperLoud features">
      <article class="feature feature-dark">
        <span class="feature-index">A</span>
        <h3>Speak freely</h3>
        <p>Put your perspective into words and let it meet the world on your terms.</p>
        <img src="/assets/image1.jpg" alt="Abstract warm-toned artwork">
      </article>
      <article class="feature feature-light">
        <span class="feature-index">B</span>
        <h3>React honestly</h3>
        <p>Vote on what moves you. A thoughtful response can change the whole conversation.</p>
        <img src="/assets/image2.jpg" alt="Abstract blue-toned artwork">
      </article>
      <article class="feature feature-accent">
        <span class="feature-index">C</span>
        <h3>Stay curious</h3>
        <p>Follow a thread, discover another voice, and leave the room bigger than you found it.</p>
        <img src="/assets/image3.jpg" alt="Abstract green-toned artwork">
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="statement" aria-labelledby="statement-title">
      <p class="section-number">02 / THE POINT</p>
      <h2 id="statement-title">Every thought<br><em>counts.</em></h2>
      <a class="outline-link" href="/login">Make yours heard <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
    </section>

    <section class="terms" id="terms" aria-labelledby="terms-title">
      <div class="terms-heading">
        <p class="section-number">03 / COMMUNITY CODE</p>
        <h2 id="terms-title">Keep it<br><span>human.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="terms-list">
        <div class="term-item"><span>01</span><p><strong>Make space.</strong> Disagree with ideas without diminishing the person behind them.</p></div>
        <div class="term-item"><span>02</span><p><strong>Bring your own voice.</strong> Share work that is yours and respect the work of others.</p></div>
        <div class="term-item"><span>03</span><p><strong>Protect the room.</strong> No harassment, threats, hate speech, spam, or private information.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer" id="footer">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <p class="section-number">04 / SAY HELLO</p>
      <h2>Keep the<br><em>signal alive.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <div>
        <p class="footer-label">WhisperLoud</p>
        <p class="footer-muted">A community for bold and curious minds.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="primary-link" href="mailto:echoes@gmail.com">echoes@gmail.com <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
    </div>
    <p class="copyright">Built for honest conversation.</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="/index.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
